/T (Interpretation: the Default group has 90 compromised hosts out of 150 \(60%\), compared with 30/140 \(21.4%\) for Hardened and 15/110 \(13.6%\) for Segmented. The observed pattern is consistent with the security team's concern that Default configurations are more frequently compromised. The formal p-value from the R output determines statistical significance; an association does not by itself prove that configuration alone caused the compromise. )
