703 0 obj
<<
/Title (Ihaveprepared thisassignment to demonstrate how statistical methods can support the assessment of network and web-application security. The work follows the five tasks and evidence requirements in the assignment brief. Important reproducibility note: Task 1 and Task 4 explicitly permit constructed or simulated security data, so the worked examples use clearly labelled simulated observations. Task 2 requires a real public dataset. The R program below is designed to download and analyse the NSL-KDD training file; the final numeric EDA and Task 3 outputs are generated by running that program against the real file. I have not invented dataset measurements or p-values. The program saves the outputs and figures so they can be attached as evidence.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 574 0 R
>>
endobj
