/Title (Cost-aware recommendation:Enhanced is the provisional deployment choice if the analysis confirms a meaningful improvement over Standardand no practically important improvement of Premium over Enhanced. The brief states that Enhanced costs 30% morethan Standard; therefore the extra blocked-attack benefit should be weighed against this operating cost. A pilot onrepresentative hosts, confidence intervals for the improvement, false-positive rates, maintenance burden andcompatibility testing are required before a full rollout. Since the data are simulated, this is a decision framework ratherthan proof of real-world superiority.)
