1027 0 obj
<<
/Title (Deliberate error: use a pooled-variance independent t-test \(var.equal = TRUE\) even when the two groups have substantially unequal variances and sample sizes. This can produce an unreliable standard error and p-value. Correction: use Welch's t-test \(var.equal = FALSE\), which does not assume equal variances. Compare the two outputs and explain whether the conclusion changes. The corrected test is preferred when variance equality is not supported.)
/Dest [19 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1004 0 R
>>
endobj
